Icons in this folder never follow the chosen pack.

The window control glyphs (window-close, window-maximize, window-minimize,
window-restore) are part of Encore and carry the licence in COPYING.

The brand marks (applemusic, deezer, firefoxbrowser, spotify, tidal, youtubemusic) come from Simple Icons
(https://simpleicons.org), released under CC0 1.0. Each mark stays the
trademark of its owner and is used only to point at that service.

The middle-scroll anchor (scroll) is part of Encore and carries the licence in COPYING.

The app mark (encore) is part of Encore and carries the licence in COPYING.
